WEBVTT

01:18.770 --> 01:21.910
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.010 --> 01:24.860
[Episode 6]

01:25.350 --> 01:26.280
What do you mean?

01:28.150 --> 01:29.480
I-Is the food poisoned?

01:30.430 --> 01:31.310
No, no.

01:32.150 --> 01:34.000
N-No, it's not poisoned.

01:34.000 --> 01:35.070
It really isn't, I swear.

01:35.070 --> 01:36.530
I swear it's not poisoned!

01:36.590 --> 01:37.930
No, it's just that...

01:38.120 --> 01:40.039
I want you to help me revise
my research report.

01:40.039 --> 01:40.900
Can you help me?

01:42.120 --> 01:43.180
A research report?

01:46.070 --> 01:47.729
You almost scared me to death.

01:49.070 --> 01:50.600
You finished it so quickly?

01:50.680 --> 01:52.660
Yes, but it's not perfect yet.

01:52.789 --> 01:53.509
I was thinking,

01:53.509 --> 01:56.000
since you're one of the people in charge

01:56.030 --> 01:57.120
of the Shanlifang IPO project,

01:57.120 --> 01:58.360
it would be great if you could

01:58.360 --> 01:59.490
give me some advice.

02:01.120 --> 02:02.120
I see.

02:03.960 --> 02:05.900
You want to use this

02:06.030 --> 02:08.039
to win Fang Yun over.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.169
Exactly.

02:10.550 --> 02:12.200
That would be a huge favor.

02:12.470 --> 02:13.630
It's so huge

02:14.360 --> 02:16.290
that one meal isn't nearly enough.

02:20.150 --> 02:21.079
Unless...

02:21.079 --> 02:21.870
Unless what?

02:22.750 --> 02:24.210
You want a rent reduction?

02:25.120 --> 02:26.520
A hundred yuan is the max.

02:26.840 --> 02:28.620
You think I'm a money-grubber

02:28.910 --> 02:29.910
like you?

02:31.310 --> 02:34.560
Unless you willingly call me your teacher.

02:40.120 --> 02:42.280
What? You don't want to?

02:44.190 --> 02:46.920
Have you heard the story
of the one-word teacher?

02:47.190 --> 02:49.240
In ancient times,
just for changing one word,

02:49.240 --> 02:51.410
people would become someone's student.

02:51.410 --> 02:53.440
You are just too reluctant to learn.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.630
No, that's not what I meant.

02:55.780 --> 02:57.140
I mean,

02:57.240 --> 02:59.360
I don't even know
if your advice is good or not yet.

02:59.360 --> 03:00.630
Are you doubting me?

03:04.290 --> 03:06.100
Fine. Very well.

03:06.430 --> 03:08.800
It's a bit of a waste of my talents,
but I'll condescend

03:08.800 --> 03:09.870
to check it out for you.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.680
Bring me the research report.

03:10.680 --> 03:12.710
Really? Just a moment!

03:21.630 --> 03:24.079
Here, take a good look.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.110
[Comprehensive Research Report
of the Shanlifang Hotel]

03:23.130 --> 03:23.730
[Solidifying the Industrial Layout
While Awaiting the Right IPO Window]

03:34.940 --> 03:36.060
[Comprehensive Research Report
of the Shanlifang Hotel]

03:36.079 --> 03:37.220
[Solidifying the Industrial Layout
While Awaiting the Right IPO Window]

03:46.840 --> 03:49.860
Wait, what's with that expression
of yours?

03:49.880 --> 03:52.079
Your eyebrows are k-knitted together.

03:52.840 --> 03:53.730
Is it that bad?

03:57.800 --> 03:59.270
Really?

03:59.750 --> 04:02.560
-Can you let me focus on analyzing it?
-Wait, you can just tell me...

04:02.560 --> 04:05.290
Be quiet for a moment.
Let me analyze it properly.

04:09.190 --> 04:11.320
Then take your time to take a good look.

04:16.950 --> 04:18.220
Is it that bad?

04:38.900 --> 04:43.150
♪ No need to guess the ending
right from the beginning ♪

04:46.070 --> 04:51.020
♪ Let the melody play
among the chords and the wind ♪

04:53.800 --> 04:59.110
♪ And no need to demand
that yesterday keeps its promises ♪

05:00.490 --> 05:05.990
♪ Leave some surprises in life
to the unknown ♪

05:07.020 --> 05:08.270
[Zhao De]

05:08.150 --> 05:12.290
♪ Also, there's no need
to force the closest bonds ♪

05:14.120 --> 05:14.680
Hello.

05:14.910 --> 05:19.730
♪ I might be left alone,
but I have your warmth ♪

05:16.810 --> 05:19.680
I've figured out a solution
for the Shanlifang matter.

05:19.680 --> 05:21.990
Just lead the team to work normally.

05:22.070 --> 05:23.330
I will handle the rest.

05:23.010 --> 05:27.740
♪ And there's no need to dwell
on right or wrong—not because of fear ♪

05:26.000 --> 05:26.600
Okay.

05:29.860 --> 05:35.590
♪ A hug far outweighs endless apologies ♪

05:36.930 --> 05:39.330
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

05:40.100 --> 05:43.290
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

05:44.780 --> 05:50.440
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

05:49.560 --> 05:50.740
How is it? Huh?

05:51.600 --> 05:52.270
Not bad.

05:51.710 --> 05:53.890
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

05:52.480 --> 05:53.560
I told you there definitely

05:53.560 --> 05:54.870
isn't any problem with what I wrote.

05:54.700 --> 05:57.780
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

05:55.040 --> 05:55.870
Not exactly.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.940
There are many places
that need to be revised. Here.

05:58.940 --> 05:59.540
Tell me about it.

05:59.450 --> 06:00.820
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

06:01.750 --> 06:05.420
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

06:04.310 --> 06:04.960
Look.

06:06.420 --> 06:08.600
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

06:06.560 --> 06:07.720
Shanlifang Hotel Group

06:07.720 --> 06:09.830
has a significant difference
in market positioning,

06:09.410 --> 06:12.420
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

06:09.920 --> 06:12.850
so there is no such thing
as industrial competition.

06:13.920 --> 06:20.050
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

06:17.510 --> 06:19.480
That's awesome, teacher.

06:21.050 --> 06:23.180
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

06:21.830 --> 06:24.290
You are seeing me as your teacher already?
That's so quick.

06:24.290 --> 06:27.810
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

06:24.510 --> 06:25.700
When it comes to research reports,

06:25.700 --> 06:27.190
I should really learn from you.

06:27.190 --> 06:28.480
But you are still far

06:28.510 --> 06:29.950
from officially being my teacher.

06:29.270 --> 06:31.430
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

06:30.480 --> 06:32.550
This is how you repay people
after using them?

06:32.550 --> 06:33.610
No, it's not like that.

06:33.159 --> 06:40.360
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

06:34.430 --> 06:36.360
I'll cook for you. You pick the day.

06:37.070 --> 06:38.510
That's more like it.

06:39.120 --> 06:41.240
So this also needs to be revised, right?

06:41.240 --> 06:42.800
Of course, it needs a revision.

06:42.800 --> 06:46.260
I've been talking about it for a while.
Do you even remember it?

06:59.990 --> 07:01.450
Aren't you going to sleep?

07:01.920 --> 07:03.850
I won't hit the sack until I'm done.

07:06.520 --> 07:07.130
Fine.

07:07.360 --> 07:10.630
I've noticed that you're pretty efficient
in getting things done.

07:10.630 --> 07:11.960
But I'm just wondering.

07:12.750 --> 07:14.790
If you were like this before,

07:15.310 --> 07:16.500
you wouldn't have worked until now

07:16.500 --> 07:18.100
just to reach this position.

07:18.720 --> 07:19.780
I was silly before.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.280
For the so-called family

07:21.280 --> 07:22.740
and resource allocation,

07:22.870 --> 07:24.160
I wasted plenty of opportunities.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.090
Come on.

07:25.750 --> 07:27.310
Don't flatter yourself.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.480
I've heard this kind of talk a lot.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.280
Were you being held at gunpoint

07:33.310 --> 07:35.570
and forced to make that decision or what?

07:35.780 --> 07:37.690
People just use this as an excuse

07:37.860 --> 07:39.970
to avoid competition

07:40.000 --> 07:42.350
and settle for the status quo, you know?

07:48.480 --> 07:50.630
You're actually
quite interesting sometimes.

07:50.630 --> 07:51.830
What makes you say so?

07:53.040 --> 07:54.760
When other girls broke up,

07:54.800 --> 07:56.330
they cried and made a scene.

07:56.630 --> 07:59.230
But you've been acting
as if nothing happened.

08:00.360 --> 08:02.720
Did the feelings and love fade away
after such a long time,

08:02.720 --> 08:05.560
or did you realize it was no big deal
after breaking up?

08:05.560 --> 08:06.560
That's not right.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.660
The longer you're together,
the deeper the feelings.

08:10.630 --> 08:11.870
When love fades,

08:12.160 --> 08:14.760
family affection and friendship
get mixed in.

08:15.750 --> 08:17.090
Losing this kind of love

08:17.870 --> 08:19.800
will cause you intolerable agony.

08:21.720 --> 08:24.110
I really don't see that in you.

08:27.150 --> 08:29.700
Do I have to wail
or make a scene to look sad?

08:29.910 --> 08:31.710
Do you think I have time to be sad?

08:31.880 --> 08:33.299
Is my research report done,

08:33.299 --> 08:34.429
or have I found a job,

08:34.789 --> 08:36.919
or do I no longer have a mortgage to pay?

08:37.030 --> 08:38.020
That person was

08:38.360 --> 08:41.120
the biggest bug in my life plan.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.650
After the patch,

08:42.960 --> 08:44.820
he doesn't need to exist anymore.

09:04.150 --> 09:05.450
All done.

09:18.440 --> 09:21.200
Thank you, Li Yifei.

09:47.670 --> 09:48.420
You're up?

09:48.750 --> 09:50.750
I'm heading out.
Have the meal on your own.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.880
Where are you going?

09:52.080 --> 09:53.140
I'm going on a date.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.980
With whom?

09:55.240 --> 09:55.970
Take a guess.

09:56.000 --> 09:56.800
I won't.

09:57.120 --> 09:57.840
Just guess.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.240
Just tell me.

10:00.870 --> 10:03.060
With Qian Fei and Dang Yu.

10:03.090 --> 10:05.050
Who else could it be? Come on...

10:05.240 --> 10:07.730
Qian Fei and Dang Yu?

10:08.000 --> 10:08.930
I don't think so.

10:09.440 --> 10:13.200
Are you going on a date
with your little lover?

10:14.320 --> 10:14.980
Otherwise,

10:15.030 --> 10:18.060
why is someone not wearing her ring?

10:20.670 --> 10:22.600
You are measuring
the stature of a great man

10:22.600 --> 10:23.980
with a petty man's mind.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.520
I knew you would ask that.

10:25.870 --> 10:26.910
Just think about it.

10:26.910 --> 10:28.240
Fei went through a breakup not long ago.

10:28.240 --> 10:30.260
Would it be appropriate for me

10:30.280 --> 10:31.940
to wear a huge diamond ring

10:31.960 --> 10:33.420
and show up in front of her?

10:44.740 --> 10:46.070
[Poming, my level is low now
because I accidentally]

10:46.090 --> 10:47.380
[gave my gear away.]

10:47.400 --> 10:48.780
[You know what I've really got.]

10:48.800 --> 10:49.940
[How about you take a look
at my recent stats?]

10:49.970 --> 10:51.410
[Please give me a chance
to join the team. Please!]

10:54.210 --> 10:55.570
[Big Brother Poming,
I got two new pieces of gear.]

10:55.600 --> 10:57.210
[Poming, I'm grinding
to improve my stats.]

11:06.080 --> 11:08.600
Son, no matter what,

11:08.650 --> 11:10.110
you need to eat something.

11:10.580 --> 11:11.650
I'm not eating!

11:11.680 --> 11:12.800
Leave me alone.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.190
[Please think about it
and give me another chance, will you?]

11:35.750 --> 11:37.480
Come on, let me propose a toast.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.640
We've gathered here today

11:39.660 --> 11:41.250
to celebrate our bestie

11:41.270 --> 11:43.350
moving into a new house
and dumping the jerk.

11:43.350 --> 11:43.660
Right!

11:43.660 --> 11:44.910
And she's starting a new chapter in life.

11:44.910 --> 11:45.480
Cheers.

11:45.510 --> 11:46.230
Cheers.

11:49.460 --> 11:50.510
I'm starving.

11:51.840 --> 11:53.270
Why are you in such a hurry?

11:53.270 --> 11:54.390
How could I not be?

11:54.390 --> 11:55.420
The meal was delayed

11:55.420 --> 11:56.790
until now just to wait for you.

11:56.790 --> 11:57.600
You must be starving.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.830
Fine, have this piece of meat.

12:00.960 --> 12:01.790
It's hot!

12:05.240 --> 12:06.200
Have some more.

12:07.960 --> 12:10.430
Yu, you have quite an appetite.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.150
It's honestly a bit scary.

12:13.840 --> 12:15.920
If you worked as much as I did,

12:15.940 --> 12:17.200
you'd be the same as me.

12:18.870 --> 12:21.000
Are you really planning
to go back to He Jing?

12:21.000 --> 12:21.630
Yes.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.080
I'm not doing it just for the money.

12:24.080 --> 12:26.030
I also want to prove my capabilities.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.860
I don't want to stay
in my comfort zone anymore.

12:27.860 --> 12:29.720
Do you have to stick to this one path?

12:29.720 --> 12:31.630
He Jing isn't the only choice
in the industry.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.830
But He Jing is the industry benchmark.

12:34.270 --> 12:34.920
Exactly.

12:35.030 --> 12:37.290
Besides, I don't have
any front desk experience.

12:37.290 --> 12:38.390
If I work with Director Fang,

12:38.390 --> 12:40.160
I can avoid a lot of detours.

12:42.360 --> 12:44.180
But if you join her project team,

12:44.240 --> 12:47.240
you'll have to take charge
of the Shanlifang project.

12:47.670 --> 12:49.000
What's wrong with that?

12:52.630 --> 12:54.750
Are you afraid
that if I'm in the same project team

12:54.750 --> 12:56.600
as that person, it will be awkward,

12:56.600 --> 12:58.400
and people will gossip about us?

12:59.790 --> 13:01.860
Yeah, didn't I tell you before?

13:02.210 --> 13:04.000
If those people in the office
learn about it,

13:04.000 --> 13:05.600
rumors will spread for sure.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.160
It's fine.
You don't need to worry about it at all.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.440
A clean hand wants no washing.

13:08.440 --> 13:10.180
I have nothing to do with him.

13:10.270 --> 13:11.880
It's not about
whether you're afraid or not.

13:11.880 --> 13:13.000
You need to be cautious.

13:13.000 --> 13:15.260
Anyway, just don't tell anyone about it.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.850
Anyway, I won't let
any of them visit my house.

13:18.470 --> 13:19.310
[Resume of the Newly-Appointed Staff
in Finance Department Management]

13:19.330 --> 13:21.530
[Wang Ruohai, Finance Department]

13:21.840 --> 13:22.500
[Resume of Wang Ruohai,
Finance Department]

13:22.530 --> 13:25.940
[Shanlifang Group Personal Resume]

13:25.960 --> 13:27.260
[Basic Information: Name—Wang Ruohai]

13:28.910 --> 13:30.050
That's weird.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.900
Doesn't my landlady know
that her ex-boyfriend

13:34.000 --> 13:35.540
works at Shanlifang?

13:38.320 --> 13:39.840
She probably doesn't know.

13:39.840 --> 13:41.180
Otherwise, she wouldn't be so eager

13:41.180 --> 13:42.980
to join Fang Yun's project team.

13:43.540 --> 13:45.750
So what my landlady will face is

13:45.770 --> 13:49.220
seeing her ex-boyfriend
and his current girlfriend every day.

13:46.880 --> 13:50.260
[Awards: Outstanding Manager
of Nalan Maide Bank]

13:49.510 --> 13:51.970
And they are the clients

13:52.000 --> 13:53.000
she must obey.

13:56.320 --> 13:58.920
Even I don't dare to think about it
any further.

14:16.940 --> 14:19.220
Here you are, Fragrant Grass.

14:19.580 --> 14:21.840
This is so beautiful.

14:23.870 --> 14:25.320
Someone's been texting you.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.360
Aren't you going to reply?

14:26.360 --> 14:28.490
Take a look for me. It's my alt account.

14:31.390 --> 14:32.390
So many messages.

14:34.400 --> 14:36.400
[This is all a man-made disaster.
Please help me. I can't take it anymore.]

14:36.420 --> 14:37.800
[As long as you give me a chance,
I can do anything.]

14:37.840 --> 14:43.140
[Saving a life is more meritorious
than anything else, Poming.]

14:40.510 --> 14:41.750
Take a look yourself.

14:44.870 --> 14:46.270
This man just won't stop.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.090
Ignore him. He's just a psycho.

14:48.670 --> 14:50.300
You have an admirer?

14:51.160 --> 14:52.280
What admirer?

14:52.310 --> 14:54.210
It's the one I told you
who wanted to join the team,

14:54.210 --> 14:55.140
Prime Minister.

14:55.550 --> 14:58.520
Poming, Poming, bro.

14:57.020 --> 14:58.250
[Big Brother Poming, GOAT, legend,
are you still there?]

14:58.840 --> 15:00.910
He thinks you are a man?

15:01.180 --> 15:02.690
That's exactly what I want.

15:02.690 --> 15:03.380
I never disclose

15:03.380 --> 15:05.140
my personal information online.

15:05.140 --> 15:06.260
He's sent you so many messages.

15:06.260 --> 15:07.730
If you're not even replying,

15:07.730 --> 15:08.790
it'd be so pitiful.

15:09.380 --> 15:10.970
You're always the soft-hearted one.

15:10.970 --> 15:12.760
Fine, since you said so,

15:12.780 --> 15:13.840
I'll text him back.

15:15.420 --> 15:16.690
Cheers.

15:20.380 --> 15:21.810
You're probably a minor, huh?

15:21.810 --> 15:23.600
Focus on your studies
and don't fall behind.

15:23.600 --> 15:26.110
I'm an adult, and I'm super reliable.

15:26.210 --> 15:28.340
You can test me if you don't believe it.

15:28.690 --> 15:29.950
I have no time for that.

15:31.610 --> 15:33.070
Can I be a backup?

15:34.380 --> 15:35.250
A backup?

15:35.330 --> 15:37.660
Our team rarely has
any special situations.

15:37.660 --> 15:39.810
The chance
for a backup to play is almost zero.

15:39.810 --> 15:40.720
It doesn't matter!

15:40.720 --> 15:43.250
I can be a backup and do chores
at the same time.

15:44.780 --> 15:46.380
Do you have that much leisure time?

15:46.380 --> 15:48.300
As long as I can contribute to the team,

15:48.300 --> 15:50.030
I'm even willing to skip sleep.

15:56.070 --> 15:57.430
You said it.

15:57.540 --> 15:59.660
Don't complain
that I maltreat you in the future.

15:59.660 --> 16:00.880
No, I won't!

16:00.970 --> 16:01.790
Dear Poming,

16:01.810 --> 16:03.940
just rest assured and leave this to me.

16:22.920 --> 16:26.030
[Warmonger Soul: Prime Minister]

16:27.690 --> 16:30.020
All right, we're leaving Jingjing to you.

16:30.200 --> 16:32.790
Don't worry.
I promise I'll treat her well,

16:32.930 --> 16:33.690
although

16:33.690 --> 16:34.610
I'll never be able

16:34.610 --> 16:35.850
to compete with her besties

16:35.850 --> 16:37.210
for a chance to have dinner with her.

16:37.210 --> 16:39.000
Alright, stop acting pitiful.

16:39.020 --> 16:41.300
After I successfully join
the Shanlifang project team,

16:41.300 --> 16:42.610
we will have a great meal again.

16:42.610 --> 16:44.540
This time,
family members are allowed to join.

16:44.540 --> 16:45.150
Shanlifang...

16:45.150 --> 16:46.900
We two will come for it together.

16:46.900 --> 16:47.730
We'll take our leave.

16:47.730 --> 16:48.930
We will come together.

16:48.930 --> 16:49.570
Alright, alright.

16:49.570 --> 16:50.970
S-Stop being so lovey-dovey
in front of me.

16:50.970 --> 16:51.780
Are you nuts?

16:51.810 --> 16:52.700
Hurry up and leave.

16:52.700 --> 16:53.090
We're leaving.

16:53.090 --> 16:53.780
We'll be going then.

16:53.780 --> 16:54.260
-Bye.
-Bye-bye.

16:54.260 --> 16:54.540
Bye-bye.

16:54.540 --> 16:54.810
Bye-bye.

16:54.810 --> 16:55.490
Bye-bye.

17:04.700 --> 17:06.240
I should probably get going, too.

17:06.240 --> 17:07.400
I'm leaving this wine for you.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.940
How can I finish all this wine?

17:08.940 --> 17:10.839
We can drink it next time we come.

17:15.780 --> 17:17.300
Make sure you keep it well.

17:17.810 --> 17:19.329
Got it.

17:34.020 --> 17:35.170
Why are you here?

17:36.090 --> 17:38.780
Couldn't I come over
to my bestie's place for a meal?

17:38.780 --> 17:41.020
Oh, right, you are the bestie
of Yifei's landlady.

17:41.020 --> 17:42.420
Are you here for Li Yifei?

17:43.740 --> 17:45.700
You are not drunk this time, are you?

17:45.700 --> 17:47.100
I promise I didn't drink.

17:47.300 --> 17:47.810
Okay.

17:48.330 --> 17:49.790
Remember to go back early.

17:50.920 --> 17:51.860
Well...

17:55.130 --> 17:56.260
My name is Jun Cheng.

17:56.540 --> 17:58.260
May I have your name, please?

17:58.810 --> 17:59.740
I'm Dang Yu.

18:00.650 --> 18:01.490
Dang Yu.

18:02.500 --> 18:05.160
I'm really sorry
about what happened last time.

18:05.170 --> 18:07.850
It's fine.
I was just teasing you at the bar.

18:07.850 --> 18:08.900
Don't feel bad.

18:09.060 --> 18:10.170
I threw you down, too.

18:10.170 --> 18:11.740
Let's just call it even.

18:12.980 --> 18:15.890
Alright, then, let me treat you
to a meal some other time.

18:15.890 --> 18:18.410
There's really no need.
I'm usually quite busy.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.600
Don't get me wrong.

18:19.780 --> 18:21.230
I mean...

18:22.740 --> 18:24.260
Qian Fei is your bestie,

18:24.330 --> 18:25.790
and Yifei is my good buddy.

18:26.060 --> 18:26.650
If you think

18:26.650 --> 18:28.260
it's awkward for us to have a meal alone,

18:28.260 --> 18:30.120
I can ask the two of them to join us.

18:30.810 --> 18:32.810
Man, you're quite sincere.

18:34.780 --> 18:36.160
Okay, let me see when I have time.

18:36.160 --> 18:37.090
I'll WeChat you.

18:37.540 --> 18:37.870
Okay.

18:38.040 --> 18:38.770
I'm leaving.

18:39.020 --> 18:40.550
I'll wait for your message.

18:48.910 --> 18:51.940
Wait, she didn't give me her WeChat.

19:04.300 --> 19:06.810
So Qian Fei still doesn't know

19:07.060 --> 19:09.320
that Wang Ruohai has joined Shanlifang?

19:09.540 --> 19:10.470
No, she doesn't.

19:11.540 --> 19:13.010
Then you should tell her.

19:13.060 --> 19:14.860
Think about what she has to face—

19:15.090 --> 19:16.490
a cheating ex-boyfriend

19:16.570 --> 19:18.090
and his current girlfriend,

19:18.090 --> 19:20.220
who is also the heiress of Shanlifang.

19:21.460 --> 19:22.540
It's too messy.

19:23.330 --> 19:25.220
What a mess.

19:27.700 --> 19:30.130
So do you want her to join or not?

19:48.610 --> 19:49.860
Do you think

19:50.170 --> 19:52.370
she really wants to have dinner with me,

19:52.850 --> 19:54.510
or she's just brushing me off?

19:56.890 --> 19:59.290
I'm asking you something. Don't ignore me.

19:59.610 --> 20:01.050
Neither.

20:01.890 --> 20:02.940
Then what is it?

20:04.170 --> 20:07.100
She couldn't even be bothered
to brush you off.

20:13.300 --> 20:15.350
No way, you have to help me.

20:16.170 --> 20:17.630
How?

20:17.740 --> 20:20.400
At least help me
get her contact info, right?

20:22.940 --> 20:24.800
Are you actually falling for her?

20:27.030 --> 20:29.690
I really don't know
if I'm falling for her or not,

20:29.900 --> 20:31.140
but I just feel that

20:31.570 --> 20:33.060
she's different from others.

20:33.060 --> 20:34.260
How is she different?

20:36.460 --> 20:37.320
Think about it.

20:37.500 --> 20:39.550
One second she's

20:39.700 --> 20:41.570
such a petite and cute girl,

20:41.810 --> 20:43.700
and the next, boom,

20:43.850 --> 20:45.330
she suddenly threw you to the ground.

20:45.330 --> 20:46.730
How impressive was that?

20:48.810 --> 20:51.170
Are you a masochist or something?

20:53.980 --> 20:55.090
I don't think so.

20:56.220 --> 20:57.300
Anyway, I just feel

20:57.300 --> 20:59.240
that she has many different sides.

20:59.300 --> 21:01.300
I want to learn more about her.

21:03.330 --> 21:05.540
I only know she is Qian Fei's colleague

21:05.740 --> 21:07.540
and works at He Jing Securities.

21:07.540 --> 21:08.400
Anything else?

21:08.610 --> 21:11.300
That's all.
You'll have to dig out the rest yourself.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.610
No way!

21:12.610 --> 21:15.630
Help me ask your landlady about her.

21:16.650 --> 21:19.540
Am I the kind of person who gossips?

21:24.170 --> 21:25.090
Oh, right,

21:25.850 --> 21:28.330
you are a tall, rich, and handsome guy
dating a supermodel.

21:28.330 --> 21:31.860
Of course, you don't understand
the misery of us single people.

21:35.260 --> 21:36.570
Oh, you broke up with her.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.700
I forgot. Sorry.

21:38.170 --> 21:40.200
It's only because you don't
really look heartbroken.

21:40.200 --> 21:40.930
You even seem

21:42.060 --> 21:43.590
to have gained some weight.

21:44.740 --> 21:45.610
Impossible!

21:45.700 --> 21:46.190
Really.

22:02.170 --> 22:04.170
I do seem to have gained some weight.

22:05.300 --> 22:08.100
I shouldn't eat too much
of my landlady's cooking.

22:10.650 --> 22:12.330
Your landlady cooks for you?

22:13.500 --> 22:15.330
Well, well, Li Yifei,

22:15.330 --> 22:17.990
no wonder you're glowing
even after a breakup.

22:18.130 --> 22:20.170
You're already dating a new one
so quickly?

22:20.170 --> 22:21.230
As expected of you.

22:21.540 --> 22:22.690
Don't slander me.

22:22.810 --> 22:23.810
Just look at her.

22:23.980 --> 22:25.220
Is she even my type?

22:25.740 --> 22:26.740
If she's not your type,

22:26.740 --> 22:27.890
why are you still staying here?

22:27.890 --> 22:30.330
Didn't you say Gui Lili rented this place,

22:30.330 --> 22:31.860
and you were not satisfied?

22:31.940 --> 22:33.980
I still need money to move out.

22:34.650 --> 22:35.740
If you want to move out,

22:35.740 --> 22:37.900
there are millions of ways to do it.

22:38.090 --> 22:39.420
There's only one reason

22:39.940 --> 22:40.800
for you to stay.

22:44.060 --> 22:45.320
I will just ignore you.

22:49.230 --> 22:50.820
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

23:04.480 --> 23:06.820
[Marketing Department]

23:06.900 --> 23:13.400
[Marketing Director's Office]

23:16.390 --> 23:17.680
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

23:19.570 --> 23:21.190
[Marketing Director's Office]

23:57.740 --> 23:58.370
Don't worry.

23:58.370 --> 24:00.910
I've already put your research report
in your role model's office.

24:00.910 --> 24:02.510
Just wait for the reply.

24:04.910 --> 24:06.990
[Thank you, Yu.]

24:15.890 --> 24:21.000
[Marketing Director's Office]

24:29.130 --> 24:32.710
[Marketing Director's Office]

24:37.090 --> 24:38.030
I'm back.

25:00.090 --> 25:01.850
How could you even eat such a thing?

25:01.850 --> 25:02.910
What are you doing?

25:04.260 --> 25:05.260
I'm telling you.

25:05.260 --> 25:05.980
In this house,

25:05.980 --> 25:07.840
no one is allowed to eat junk food.

25:08.940 --> 25:09.890
You're not the landlord.

25:09.890 --> 25:11.650
Why should I follow your rules?

25:11.980 --> 25:12.980
Since we're sharing a house,

25:12.980 --> 25:14.330
we should be considerate.

25:14.330 --> 25:15.610
You're eating something
with such a strong smell.

25:15.610 --> 25:16.670
It makes me

25:17.500 --> 25:18.360
feel nauseous.

25:19.020 --> 25:20.870
I'll just eat in my room, okay?

25:21.540 --> 25:22.980
So anything is fine in the room, huh?

25:22.980 --> 25:24.610
Then can I smoke in my room, too?

25:24.610 --> 25:25.900
How is that the same?

25:25.940 --> 25:26.810
If you smoke a cigarette,

25:26.810 --> 25:28.130
the smell will linger all day.

25:28.130 --> 25:29.060
I can still smell it.

25:29.060 --> 25:30.190
It's the same logic.

25:30.460 --> 25:31.850
I won't smoke in my room,

25:32.410 --> 25:34.810
and you don't eat instant noodles
in yours.

25:35.090 --> 25:37.110
This is my dinner, bro.

25:37.330 --> 25:39.060
I'll order takeout for dinner.

25:40.610 --> 25:41.300
Takeout isn't

25:41.300 --> 25:43.360
any healthier than instant noodles.

25:44.540 --> 25:45.610
Don't worry.

25:45.780 --> 25:47.290
The takeout I order is

25:47.940 --> 25:51.170
definitely delicious, healthy,

25:52.020 --> 25:53.700
and nutritionally balanced.

26:01.740 --> 26:03.270
How much did this meal cost?

26:04.130 --> 26:05.150
Forget about it.

26:05.170 --> 26:06.830
I didn't ask you to pay.

26:09.020 --> 26:10.780
I'm not trying to take advantage of you.

26:10.780 --> 26:12.220
You threw my dinner away,

26:12.220 --> 26:13.090
so I had to...

26:13.120 --> 26:14.180
Alright, alright.

26:14.620 --> 26:15.940
Cut the crap and eat up.

26:16.370 --> 26:17.890
I'll dig in then.

26:18.710 --> 26:19.890
Thanks for the meal.

26:27.980 --> 26:29.540
What have you been busy with today

26:29.540 --> 26:31.540
that you didn't even bother to cook?

26:33.130 --> 26:34.890
Although I submitted the research report,

26:34.890 --> 26:36.620
it only scratches the surface.

26:37.170 --> 26:38.540
Shanlifang is very complicated.

26:38.540 --> 26:40.270
I need to investigate further.

26:42.330 --> 26:43.540
You're so proactive?

26:44.220 --> 26:46.060
Did Fang Yun agree to reinstate you?

26:46.060 --> 26:47.000
Not yet,

26:47.300 --> 26:49.960
but it's always right
to be prepared in advance.

26:51.870 --> 26:52.940
But it's been a while.

26:52.940 --> 26:54.870
Why are there still no updates yet?

26:55.410 --> 26:57.500
I only submitted
the research report yesterday.

26:57.500 --> 26:59.100
It's only been a day. No rush.

27:00.370 --> 27:02.430
Based on what you know about Fang Yun,

27:02.700 --> 27:04.020
do you think she'd put off today's work

27:04.020 --> 27:05.250
until tomorrow?

27:07.650 --> 27:09.450
Something must have gone wrong.

27:12.130 --> 27:13.740
Yu is the receptionist.

27:13.810 --> 27:15.890
It was already against the rules for her
to put it on the office desk.

27:15.890 --> 27:17.290
I can't ask her to do more,

27:17.500 --> 27:19.460
as it will just affect her work.

27:19.500 --> 27:22.030
Then you should go
and hand it to her in person.

27:22.330 --> 27:24.660
Don't tell me you don't even have
the guts to do that.

27:24.660 --> 27:26.570
It's not that I don't have the guts.

27:26.570 --> 27:27.740
I just think

27:28.020 --> 27:29.850
my work results are

27:29.880 --> 27:31.680
enough to speak for themselves,

27:31.700 --> 27:33.700
and I don't need to do anything else.

27:33.700 --> 27:36.060
If it were really only about work results,

27:36.170 --> 27:38.700
you wouldn't have been
laid off, got it?

27:40.060 --> 27:42.190
You sound like you know me pretty well.

27:42.330 --> 27:43.500
After reading your research report,

27:43.500 --> 27:45.060
I do have some understanding of you.

27:45.060 --> 27:46.460
So you mean

27:46.460 --> 27:48.130
you recognize my work capability?

27:48.130 --> 27:49.020
Yup.

27:49.540 --> 27:51.670
Seeing you so pitiful and unemployed,

27:52.720 --> 27:54.220
I can't help but be kind

27:54.300 --> 27:55.500
and comfort you a bit.

27:55.650 --> 27:57.070
I don't need any comfort.

27:57.300 --> 27:58.070
I, Qian Fei,

27:58.090 --> 28:00.490
will definitely prove myself
to all of you.

28:06.140 --> 28:07.810
These shrimp are good, too. Try some.

28:07.810 --> 28:10.170
Didn't you say
it was unhealthy junk food?

28:11.500 --> 28:12.570
Delicious junk food.

28:12.570 --> 28:16.030
But it's still not as good
as the stir-fried eggplant you cook.

28:40.890 --> 28:45.830
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

28:56.500 --> 28:57.590
Director Fang,

28:57.890 --> 29:00.240
this is my research report on Shanlifang.

29:00.330 --> 29:01.070
I've had

29:01.090 --> 29:03.090
a copy put on your office desk earlier.

29:03.090 --> 29:04.570
You might have already seen it.

29:04.570 --> 29:06.430
I want to know where its flaws are.

29:08.460 --> 29:09.720
You know I'm very busy,

29:09.740 --> 29:11.060
with no spare time to waste

29:11.060 --> 29:13.060
on reading an amateur piece
written by a layman.

29:13.060 --> 29:14.130
But, Director Fang,

29:14.130 --> 29:16.540
all the statistics, explanations,
and content I did

29:16.540 --> 29:18.050
will definitely be helpful to the progress

29:18.050 --> 29:19.090
of your project team.

29:19.090 --> 29:20.820
I'm very confident about that.

29:24.890 --> 29:25.780
Satisfied?

29:29.330 --> 29:30.220
If someone is

29:30.610 --> 29:31.780
very capable at work

29:32.020 --> 29:33.810
but not recognized by the company,

29:33.810 --> 29:35.260
they won't have the chance
to show their abilities.

29:35.260 --> 29:36.980
So someone who doesn't know
how to appreciate

29:36.980 --> 29:38.540
what they have will never be of any value,

29:38.540 --> 29:39.330
understand?

29:59.540 --> 30:01.230
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

30:05.370 --> 30:09.580
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

30:06.380 --> 30:09.430
Director Fang,
I was afraid Qian Fei would bother you,

30:09.500 --> 30:11.580
so I took that...

30:12.570 --> 30:17.230
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

30:13.300 --> 30:15.130
Do you think
my office is where anyone can enter

30:15.130 --> 30:17.280
and take whatever they want?

30:17.430 --> 30:19.460
No, no, Director Fang.

30:20.260 --> 30:21.750
Sorry. I'm so sorry.

30:21.780 --> 30:23.780
I was wrong. I won't do it ever again.

30:24.170 --> 30:25.170
You may leave now.

30:27.820 --> 30:35.070
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

30:51.980 --> 30:53.810
I'm hungry! Hurry up and cook!

30:55.890 --> 30:57.370
You're bossing me around
as soon as I'm back!

30:57.370 --> 30:58.770
Do you have any humanity?

30:59.170 --> 31:01.250
You still owe me a meal, remember?

31:01.890 --> 31:02.650
You promised it.

31:02.650 --> 31:04.810
You should have still
made an appointment with me in advance!

31:04.810 --> 31:07.460
There are no ingredients left at home now,
so I can't cook.

31:07.460 --> 31:08.740
Who says you can't?

31:09.170 --> 31:11.850
I've bought the groceries.
They're in the kitchen.

31:11.850 --> 31:13.650
You actually bought groceries?

31:13.780 --> 31:15.880
I ordered them on my phone,
and they were delivered home directly.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.700
As a modern person,
don't you even know this?

31:17.700 --> 31:18.700
Hurry up and cook.

31:20.540 --> 31:21.940
He actually bought them.

31:24.130 --> 31:25.700
Never thought I'd see this.

32:08.500 --> 32:11.130
Young master, come out for dinner.

32:18.570 --> 32:19.500
He can't hear me?

32:26.780 --> 32:28.380
Are you done eavesdropping?

32:28.980 --> 32:31.640
I just wanted to see
if this door was soundproof.

32:31.980 --> 32:33.500
It's soundproof when I want it to be

32:33.500 --> 32:35.090
and not soundproof when I don't.

32:35.090 --> 32:36.550
Is it any of your business?

32:37.940 --> 32:38.560
Not bad.

32:43.810 --> 32:44.740
You met Fang Yun?

32:47.750 --> 32:48.610
It's hopeless?

33:04.020 --> 33:04.700
Landlady.

33:05.700 --> 33:06.710
Did you

33:07.170 --> 33:08.330
ever expect

33:08.810 --> 33:10.670
that we'd end up like this one day?

33:11.610 --> 33:12.610
Like what?

33:13.170 --> 33:15.570
Sitting here and having a heart-to-heart?

33:17.740 --> 33:18.500
Never.

33:19.330 --> 33:22.190
I never thought
there'd be a day like this in my life.

33:22.810 --> 33:25.560
Because in my eyes, you used to be

33:25.890 --> 33:26.740
a pervert.

33:27.170 --> 33:29.480
And to me, you were a shrew.

33:36.610 --> 33:37.610
You know what?

33:38.220 --> 33:39.870
You should thank God—

33:40.330 --> 33:41.660
you're so lucky

33:42.220 --> 33:44.780
to have such a handsome tenant.

33:46.130 --> 33:47.780
Handsome? Let me check.

33:49.220 --> 33:50.620
Do you even need to check?

33:54.300 --> 33:55.820
Two eyes,

33:56.570 --> 33:57.650
one nose,

33:57.980 --> 33:58.940
and one mouth.

33:59.970 --> 34:01.300
Yeah, pretty handsome.

34:04.460 --> 34:06.520
But what's the use of being handsome?

34:06.540 --> 34:08.330
Look at the way you act.

34:10.610 --> 34:12.210
I really can't approve of it.

34:12.210 --> 34:13.310
Look at you,

34:13.330 --> 34:14.449
living like this,

34:14.540 --> 34:17.469
sharing a house with others,
and also wasting money.

34:17.940 --> 34:20.540
I can't stand it.
I really can't stand to see it.

34:20.770 --> 34:22.730
If you can't stand it, just don't look.

34:22.730 --> 34:23.699
So,

34:23.730 --> 34:25.980
hurry up and find a chance
to move out soon.

34:25.980 --> 34:27.980
We're a single man and a single woman.

34:27.980 --> 34:30.460
It's really inappropriate
for us to live together.

34:30.460 --> 34:31.460
Hey,

34:32.219 --> 34:33.940
isn't your dad living here in Shanghai?

34:33.940 --> 34:35.290
Why don't you move back home?

34:35.290 --> 34:37.620
Why do you insist on living
away from home?

34:37.820 --> 34:39.350
My dad and I don't get along.

34:40.060 --> 34:43.190
He's never approved
of anything I did since I was a child.

34:44.130 --> 34:46.760
He is definitely the happiest person

34:47.820 --> 34:49.679
to see me sad or having a hard time.

34:52.340 --> 34:53.659
How could that be?

34:54.610 --> 34:57.100
You are father and son. You're family.

34:57.730 --> 34:58.690
What family?

34:59.380 --> 35:01.610
Let me tell you a story. Back then,

35:05.210 --> 35:06.810
when my mom was seriously ill

35:07.770 --> 35:09.300
and only had a few days left,

35:10.340 --> 35:12.800
during her most difficult
and painful time,

35:13.770 --> 35:15.570
we didn't even know where he was.

35:17.820 --> 35:19.380
He just left the two of us.

35:22.280 --> 35:24.570
We didn't know
if he was messing around somewhere

35:24.570 --> 35:25.900
or hustling somewhere.

35:27.430 --> 35:28.590
Is that a family?

35:33.980 --> 35:34.690
What?

35:37.420 --> 35:40.140
Why are you crying? I'm fine now.

35:40.980 --> 35:44.980
-It's not for you. It's about myself.
-I haven't cried, but why are you crying?

35:44.980 --> 35:48.090
I'm crying not because of you,
but because of myself.

35:49.020 --> 35:50.280
What's wrong with you?

35:50.980 --> 35:52.820
Your talk about your mother

35:53.540 --> 35:56.000
reminded me of my mother as well.

36:00.340 --> 36:04.090
My mother used to tell me

36:04.770 --> 36:06.560
to study hard

36:06.580 --> 36:08.310
and get into a good university.

36:09.820 --> 36:11.170
And the result?

36:14.420 --> 36:16.860
I ended up like this.

36:17.940 --> 36:20.380
If my mother were alive
and saw me like this,

36:20.540 --> 36:23.690
she would definitely be very sad.

36:26.900 --> 36:28.500
I spent my best years

36:29.210 --> 36:30.850
on dating

36:31.060 --> 36:33.090
and thought getting married
and having a house

36:33.090 --> 36:35.060
would be the peak of my life.

36:36.860 --> 36:39.290
But God was just punishing me.

36:41.420 --> 36:44.480
I got dumped and fired,

36:44.980 --> 36:47.330
and now I'm in massive debt.

36:48.460 --> 36:50.300
If my mom learned about this,

36:50.420 --> 36:52.210
how heartbroken she would be.

36:56.730 --> 36:57.380
Landlady,

36:58.340 --> 36:59.240
this is life,

37:00.210 --> 37:01.540
and it's no big deal.

37:02.820 --> 37:04.880
We all encounter all kinds of things.

37:14.020 --> 37:15.610
Landlady? Qian Fei?

37:18.210 --> 37:19.020
I can't believe it.

37:19.020 --> 37:20.060
How come you instantly

37:20.060 --> 37:21.720
pass out every time you drink?

37:21.900 --> 37:22.980
Seriously?

37:33.090 --> 37:33.900
Alright, don't sleep here.

37:33.900 --> 37:35.030
You'll catch a cold.

37:35.290 --> 37:37.150
Come on, go back. Go back to sleep.

37:41.650 --> 37:42.250
Oh, my God.

37:43.210 --> 37:45.120
Are you completely unconscious?

37:46.460 --> 37:47.060
Come on.

37:49.730 --> 37:51.690
Get up now. Go back to sleep.

37:53.210 --> 37:54.210
Don't sleep here.

38:01.540 --> 38:03.860
I give up. Fine, fine.

38:04.730 --> 38:06.990
I'll settle the score with you tomorrow.

38:08.570 --> 38:09.200
Come on.

38:09.340 --> 38:12.140
How could you drink yourself
straight into a coma?

39:44.210 --> 39:45.780
No matter what, Fang Yun's side

39:45.780 --> 39:47.540
should be making a big move.

39:48.690 --> 39:50.420
Why is there no reaction at all?

39:52.480 --> 39:54.410
Seems like this trick didn't work.

39:54.610 --> 39:56.780
I must confront her directly.

40:14.130 --> 40:15.900
I'm in a hurry.
Let me use the mirror first.

40:15.900 --> 40:17.240
Can you wait your turn?

40:17.260 --> 40:18.560
You don't go to work.
Y-You're not in a hurry.

40:18.560 --> 40:19.550
Excuse me?

40:19.570 --> 40:21.030
-Let me check. I'm in a rush.
-First come, first served.

40:21.030 --> 40:22.160
You don't go to work.

40:30.620 --> 40:32.480
Why did you have to fight me for it?

40:32.860 --> 40:34.120
I'm leaving. Bye-bye.

40:35.420 --> 40:36.820
So what if you have a job?

40:44.090 --> 40:45.820
Director Fang wants to meet me?

40:49.460 --> 40:51.840
This is a research report
written by a former

40:51.840 --> 40:53.170
back-office employee.

40:55.860 --> 40:58.260
I didn't bring this out
for any other reason

40:59.290 --> 41:00.890
but to make you feel ashamed.

41:03.090 --> 41:04.450
These are the most valuable words

41:04.450 --> 41:06.490
I have ever seen in the past 2 weeks.

41:06.820 --> 41:09.540
If you, investment banking elites
who work with me,

41:09.540 --> 41:11.340
have any sense of shame,

41:12.090 --> 41:13.590
you should carefully review

41:13.590 --> 41:15.090
the work you're doing.

41:15.090 --> 41:15.770
Got it?

41:18.460 --> 41:19.090
Xinyao.

41:21.650 --> 41:22.910
Make 10 copies of this.

41:30.650 --> 41:31.900
Director Fang,

41:32.170 --> 41:33.350
then should we

41:33.370 --> 41:35.040
follow the ideas of this research report

41:35.040 --> 41:35.620
and continue...

41:35.620 --> 41:36.950
Continue what?

41:37.130 --> 41:39.530
Continue to get yourselves fired like her?

41:42.170 --> 41:43.830
You just jump to conclusions.

41:45.650 --> 41:47.910
I'm asking you to sum it up.

41:48.090 --> 41:51.220
Don't be so dejected
just because I criticized you a bit.

41:51.540 --> 41:54.600
The people from Zhizhong Investment
will arrive soon.

41:54.650 --> 41:56.850
Hurry up and pull yourselves together.

41:57.290 --> 41:59.170
Since you don't have an appointment,

41:59.170 --> 42:01.970
please leave your name
and contact information.

42:02.060 --> 42:04.520
I will have him contact you
when he gets back.

42:09.150 --> 42:11.830
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

42:11.950 --> 42:12.700
[Meeting Room]

42:14.650 --> 42:15.770
See?

42:15.860 --> 42:16.750
Here,

42:16.010 --> 42:18.410
[The Market Share
of Shanlifang Hotel Group]

42:16.860 --> 42:18.950
I combined the contents
of this research report

42:18.950 --> 42:21.010
with the ones you guys wrote.

42:21.250 --> 42:24.290
Director Fang used the integrated analysis
from my research report.

42:24.290 --> 42:25.940
It seems that she really called me over

42:25.940 --> 42:27.730
to recruit me into the team.

42:32.460 --> 42:33.380
You're here.

42:34.650 --> 42:36.410
Yes, I'm back.

42:37.100 --> 42:42.500
[Meeting Room]

42:47.060 --> 42:47.860
Alright.

42:48.020 --> 42:49.820
Then, Mr. Li, let's get started.

42:49.850 --> 42:50.340
Okay.

42:52.050 --> 42:53.690
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:55.190 --> 42:56.650
[Empower the Future with Gratitude
for Everyone—2018 Annual Gala Report]

42:56.790 --> 42:57.480
[Certificate for Employee of the Year
in Shanlifang Hotel Group]

42:57.580 --> 42:58.910
The annual gala...

42:59.020 --> 43:01.290
The annual gala from 3 years ago...

43:02.250 --> 43:03.710
Have you made up your mind?

43:04.130 --> 43:05.390
I'm going on vacation.

43:05.700 --> 43:06.310
Okay.

43:06.340 --> 43:07.540
Then have a good time.

43:08.030 --> 43:08.900
Goodbye.

43:09.620 --> 43:11.350
What's your name?

43:12.860 --> 43:13.760
Xin Ba.

43:13.780 --> 43:14.860
Xin Ba,

43:15.300 --> 43:17.020
I'm the big boy, Li Yifei.

43:17.050 --> 43:18.160
Nice to meet you.

43:19.070 --> 43:20.980
Alright, big boy.
